1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,426
This is DrishtiAI.

2
00:00:02,576 --> 00:00:06,894
An offline assistant that tells a blind or
low-vision person what is in front of them.

3
00:00:08,044 --> 00:00:11,500
Most apps that describe a photo upload it to a
cloud service.

4
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:16,796
That needs a connection, costs money for every
image, and sends pictures of your home, your

5
00:00:16,796 --> 00:00:19,849
documents and your medicines to someone else's
server.

6
00:00:20,899 --> 00:00:24,340
DrishtiAI runs an open-weight vision model on
your own laptop.

7
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:29,766
A camera frame goes in, validated JSON comes
out, and the answer is spoken aloud.

8
00:00:29,916 --> 00:00:31,577
Nothing leaves the machine.

9
00:00:32,627 --> 00:00:34,965
Here is the real app, with the real model.

10
00:00:35,115 --> 00:00:38,186
Press Space, and hazards are always spoken
first.

11
00:00:40,536 --> 00:00:46,211
DrishtiAI: Careful: open sewer manhole ahead,
near. Careful: orange and white traffic cone

12
00:00:46,211 --> 00:00:46,968
ahead, near.

13
00:00:47,618 --> 00:00:52,455
Press L, and the same answer is re-worded in
Hindi, with its own offline voice.

14
00:00:53,105 --> 00:00:58,856
DrishtiAI: सावधान: सामने खुला मैनहोल, पास।
सावधान: सामने ट्रैफ़िक कोन, पास।

15
00:00:59,506 --> 00:01:01,922
Read mode reads signs and labels.

16
00:01:02,572 --> 00:01:04,920
Find mode looks for one object you name.

17
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:06,688
DrishtiAI: Found bucket: left.

18
00:01:07,738 --> 00:01:13,660
On 30 fixed test images, it caught 14 of 15
labelled hazards, and read 14 of 15 texts, in

19
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:15,923
about one and a half seconds each.

20
00:01:16,073 --> 00:01:21,802
It also raised 6 false alarms, and these numbers
are optimistic, because the prompt was tuned on

21
00:01:21,802 --> 00:01:22,757
the same images.

22
00:01:23,907 --> 00:01:27,826
It is an experimental aid, not a replacement for
a cane or a guide.

23
00:01:27,976 --> 00:01:32,741
Built solo in one day, with MIT-licensed code
and an Apache-2.0 model.

24
00:01:32,891 --> 00:01:35,648
DrishtiAI. Sight, kept private.

